<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA BOARD PRESIDENT'S XI 164-8 AT TEA V S.AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA BOARD PRESIDENT'S XI 164-8 AT TEA V S.AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>BARODA, India 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian Board</p>
<p>President's XI were 164 for eight wickets at tea on the opening</p>
<p>day of their three-day game against South Africa on Friday.</p>
</text>
